# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the value, then restart `npm run dev`.
#
# Access key for the quick-contact form, from https://web3forms.com — enter the
# inbox that should receive submissions and they email you the key. It is a
# public token (it ships inside the built JS bundle by design); keeping it here
# just makes it easy to rotate without touching source files.
#
# The form sends name/email/subject/message only — no file uploads — so the
# free Web3Forms plan covers it.
#
# NOTE: this `.env` is for LOCAL DEV ONLY — it is gitignored, so it never
# reaches the host that builds the deployed site. The key used in production
# lives in the committed `.env.production`. Update BOTH when rotating the key.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
